                width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Check a post I made a few months back. It should be helpful. Good Luck\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394133176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.161.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3892d2443ba2933f5b9183bc71750a99","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dreia85\" post=\"1903023\" timestamp=\"1440128256\"]\nHi, \n\nI am getting married in Punta Cana in July 2016 and am having a hard time finding a make up artist and hair stylist. I&#039;ve contacted Kistie Ann, Anna Nuet and Indira Sanchez, but they are unavailable or need a specific # of people to book.\n\nI would appreciate any suggestions. Thanks so much![\/quote] Contact Jazmin Abrito","Attachments":[],"Id":1906545,"PostDate":1445255964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dreia85, on 20 August 2015 - 07:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married in Punta Cana in July 2016 and am having a hard time finding a make up artist and hair stylist. I've contacted Kistie Ann, Anna Nuet and Indira Sanchez, but they are unavailable or need a specific # of people to book.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would appreciate any suggestions. Thanks so much!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0Contact Jazmin Abrito<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 12\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/30ag12yqu333h.png\" alt=\"30ag12yqu333h.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394133176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79517","Title":"Make-Up & Hairstylist In Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1445255964},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
