{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":391,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907614,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284291,"Name":"courtneylauren17","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284291.jpg?_r=1455224172","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1447709439,"LastPoster":{"Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1907614,"PostDate":1447709439,"PostContent":"Hi Ladies!!! I was just wondering if anyone can recommend to me and my fiance, a reasonably price...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneyllyons@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.8.139.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438783459,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284291.jpg?_r=1455224172","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"courtneylauren17","Id":284291,"Name":"courtneylauren17","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.8.139.143","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79744,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3f5cdda34aa97cbf095646d6270d12c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!!!\n\n\nI was just wondering if anyone can recommend to me and my fiance, a reasonably priced but great cinematographer and photographer?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are a few we have looked at but i feel like because we want both, maybe we can find somewhere that does both, and we could get a better rate? Or if there were any that were known to work together?!? Please help!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907614,"PostDate":1447709439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!!!<br><br>\nI was just wondering if anyone can recommend to me and my fiance, a reasonably priced but great cinematographer and photographer?<\/p>\n<p>There are a few we have looked at but i feel like because we want both, maybe we can find somewhere that does both, and we could get a better rate? Or if there were any that were known to work together?!? Please help!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneyllyons@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.8.139.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438783459,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284291.jpg?_r=1455224172","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":130,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"courtneylauren17","Id":284291,"Name":"courtneylauren17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79744,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by emmapalmer, 08 January 2016 - 03:56 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1452297389,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35bd95bef8551bdbbf2cca6210c6ecda","RawContent":"[quote name=\"courtneylauren17\" post=\"1907614\" timestamp=\"1447705839\"]\nHi Ladies!!!\n\nI was just wondering if anyone can recommend to me and my fiance, a reasonably priced but great cinematographer and photographer?\nThere are a few we have looked at but i feel like because we want both, maybe we can find somewhere that does both, and we could get a better rate? Or if there were any that were known to work together?!? Please help!![\/quote]\nHave you check with your resort? Usually resorts offer one or both, however they can be quite pricey. You may also want to consider searching for destination photographers that offer video optionsin your city\/province. You would be surprised to find better and more affordable options. It can work out to be a better deal taking your own vendor with the added bonus of not losing on the exchange, and only paying to one room. For example our photographer Enrique from [url=\"http:\/\/www.decordova.ca\"]www.decordova.ca[\/url] is from Toronto. We paid around $1600 Canadian and we did not have to exchange or pay for flight. I don\u2019t know if he offers video but I am sure you can find a good deal like that in your area.","Attachments":[],"Id":1909172,"PostDate":1452297294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>courtneylauren17, on 16 November 2015 - 01:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<p>Hi Ladies!!!<br><br>\nI was just wondering if anyone can recommend to me and my fiance, a reasonably priced but great cinematographer and photographer?<br>\nThere are a few we have looked at but i feel like because we want both, maybe we can find somewhere that does both, and we could get a better rate? Or if there were any that were known to work together?!? Please help!!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<br><p>Have you check with your resort? Usually resorts offer one or both, however they can be quite pricey. You may also want to consider searching for destination photographers that offer video optionsin your city\/province. You would be surprised to find better and more affordable options. It can work out to be a better deal taking your own vendor with the added bonus of not losing on the exchange, and only paying to one room. For example our photographer Enrique from <a href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> is from Toronto. We paid around $1600 Canadian and we did not have to exchange or pay for flight. I don\u2019t know if he offers video but I am sure you can find a good deal like that in your area.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer@rogers.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419948757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79744","Title":"Cinematographers\/photographers For Iberostar Rose Hall Beach Wedding!?","LastPostDate":1452297294},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
